      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The Chef tastes the pâté that Maks prepared. Maks is waiting for a compliment. Let us see what happens next in this scene. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
